    },
    {
      "lore": null,
      "name": "Clever Know-wotz",
      "rules": "In your Movement phase, at the start or end of this unit's move, you can select one friendly <k>Orks Vehicle</k> model (excluding <k>Aircraft/Titanic</k> models) within 3\" of this model: \r<ul><li>That <k>Vehicle</k> model <b>heals</b> D3 wounds.</li>\r<li>That <k>Vehicle</k> model's attacks have +1 to <b>hit rolls</b> until the start of your next Movement phase.</li></ul>",
